# The Jace planeswalker token empower Jace makes has "-1: Surveil 1." (a loyalty ability, CR 606): the turn it is made it
# has 2 loyalty, Bot1 activates the -1 in its second main phase, looks at the top card of its library and puts it into the
# graveyard.

[Bot1 Deck]
Theorist's Sanctum
Black Lotus
Jace, the Mind Sculptor
Island x4
Mountain
Island x13

[Bot2 Deck]
Island x20

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Theorist's Sanctum.Play
Bot1.Choose(Jace, the Mind Sculptor)
Bot1.Hand.Black Lotus.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Black Lotus.Activate(Color: Blue)
Bot1.Battlefield.Theorist's Sanctum.Activate(Ability: Empower)
Bot2.Pass
[T1 Bot1.Main2]
Bot1.Battlefield.Jace Token.Activate(Ability: Surveil)
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Arrange( | Mountain)

[Expect]
Bot1.Battlefield.Jace Token.Counters.Loyalty = 1
Bot1.Graveyard = Mountain; Black Lotus
